# REVIEWED: 5645d24a3ab0c725
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:5
msgid "Filter glossary"
msgstr "Glosario de filtros"

# REVIEWED: 9e35e0c69946de99
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:7
msgid ""
"This page provides more detail on the filters and options available in "
"d-portal's search function. Definitions of the codes used in each filter "
"dropdown can be found in the `IATI Standard "
"<https://iatistandard.org/en/iati-standard/203/activity-standard/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Esta página proporciona más detalles sobre los filtros y opciones "
"disponibles en la función de búsqueda de d-portal. Las definiciones de los "
"códigos utilizados en cada filtro desplegable pueden consultarse en la "
"`Norma IATI <https://iatistandard.org/es/iati-standard/203/activity-"
"standard/>`_."

# REVIEWED: 2edf767dbb498bf4
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:11
msgid "Settings:"
msgstr "Configuración:"

# REVIEWED: 9043a7f6d7d8caa5
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:13
msgid "ABC - 123"
msgstr "ABC - 123"

# REVIEWED: 4df2b3ef67dad6f0
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:14
msgid ""
"This button determines the sort order of the dropdown menus; in alphabetical"
" order, or numerical. For example, alphabetically by DAC 3 digit sector "
"codenames, or numerically by sector codes."
msgstr ""
"Este botón determina el orden de los menús desplegables, alfabético o "
"numérico. Por ejemplo, alfabéticamente por códigos de sector de 3 dígitos "
"del CAD, o numéricamente por códigos de sector."

# REVIEWED: 102e1c53b9097dee
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:18
msgid "Filters:"
msgstr "Filtros:"

# REVIEWED: 4502e05c6b7f58ad
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:20
msgid ""
"`Activity Status <https://iatistandard.org/en/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/activitystatus/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Estado de la actividad <https://iatistandard.org/es/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/activitystatus/>`_"

# REVIEWED: 48c7e9498c7552c3
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:21
msgid "A code defining the current status of an activity."
msgstr "Código que indica el estado actual de una actividad."

# REVIEWED: 68c152632d1aa3a6
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:23
msgid ""
"`Collaboration Type <https://iatistandard.org/en/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/collaborationtype/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Tipo de Colaboración <https://iatistandard.org/es/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/collaborationtype/>`_"

# REVIEWED: f8b0e02a9551b036
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:24
msgid ""
"A code defining the type of collaboration involved in an activity's "
"disbursements, for example bilateral or multilateral."
msgstr ""
"Código que indica el tipo de colaboración relacionada con los desembolsos de"
" una actividad, por ejemplo, bilateral o multilateral."

# REVIEWED: 2ea46cffb8788d04
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:26
msgid ""
"`Default Aid Type <https://iatistandard.org/en/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/aidtype/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Tipo de ayuda predeterminada <https://iatistandard.org/es/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/aidtype/>`_"

# REVIEWED: 1d68be4e338dd786
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:27
msgid ""
"A code specifying the default type of aid being supplied in an activity, "
"such as project-type intervention or budget support. Individual transactions"
" may have a different code for this element."
msgstr ""
"Código que especifica el tipo de ayuda predeterminada que se proporciona en "
"una actividad, como intervención de tipo proyecto o presupuesto de apoyo. "
"Las transacciones individuales pueden tener un código diferente para este "
"elemento."

# REVIEWED: d52bef7e04005fd1
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:30
msgid ""
"`Default Finance Type <https://iatistandard.org/en/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/financetype/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Tipo de financiación predeterminada <https://iatistandard.org/es/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/financetype/>`_"

# REVIEWED: 9d33fe2c39975542
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:31
msgid ""
"A code specifying the default type of finance being described in an "
"activity, such as grants or loans. Individual transactions may have a "
"different code for this element."
msgstr ""
"Código que especifica el tipo de financiación predeterminada que se describe"
" en una actividad, como subvenciones o préstamos. Las transacciones "
"individuales pueden tener un código diferente para este elemento."

# REVIEWED: 94eef240a1a2e1e4
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:34
msgid ""
"`Default Flow Type <https://iatistandard.org/en/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/flowtype/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Tipo de flujo predeterminado <https://iatistandard.org/es/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/flowtype/>`_"

# REVIEWED: b1e466a52d4b4a9c
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:35
msgid ""
"A code defining the default resource flow type for an activity, for example "
"Official Development Assistance (ODA). Individual transactions may have a "
"different code for this element."
msgstr ""
"Código que indica el tipo de flujo de recursos predeterminado para una "
"actividad, por ejemplo, asistencia oficial para el desarrollo (AOD). Las "
"transacciones individuales pueden tener un código diferente para este "
"elemento."

# REVIEWED: a178eb480c955c01
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:38
msgid ""
"`Default Tied Status <https://iatistandard.org/en/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/tiedstatus/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Estado vinculado predeterminado <https://iatistandard.org/es/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/tiedstatus/>`_"

# REVIEWED: 1eab01b45648a42d
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:39
msgid ""
"A code defining the default tied status of an activity; untied, tied, or "
"partially tied. Individual transactions may have a different code for this "
"element."
msgstr ""
"Código que indica el estado de vinculación predeterminado de una actividad: "
"desvinculada, vinculada o parcialmente vinculada. Las transacciones "
"individuales pueden tener un código diferente para este elemento."

# REVIEWED: d97f76731f001ec9
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:42
msgid ""
"`Document Category <https://iatistandard.org/en/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/documentcategory/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Categoría de documento <https://iatistandard.org/es/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/documentcategory/>`_"

# REVIEWED: 4ec6ce01720b649a
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:43
msgid "A code defining the category of documents linked to an activity."
msgstr ""
"Código que indica la categoría de los documentos vinculados a una actividad."

# REVIEWED: 9744d0ae4b3c4746
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:45
msgid ""
"`Humanitarian Activity <https://iatistandard.org/en/iati-"
"standard/203/activity-standard/iati-activities/iati-activity/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Actividad humanitaria <https://iatistandard.org/es/iati-"
"standard/203/activity-standard/iati-activities/iati-activity/>`_"

# REVIEWED: 877c2f7a1bdf32fb
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:46
msgid ""
"A flag which indicates an activity and/or transaction relates entirely or "
"partially to humanitarian aid."
msgstr ""
"Etiqueta que indica que una actividad o transacción está relacionada total o"
" parcialmente con la ayuda humanitaria."

# REVIEWED: 8f2f040aaab712a8
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:48
msgid ""
"`Humanitarian Scope Vocab <https://iatistandard.org/en/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/humanitarianscopevocabulary/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Vocabulario del ámbito humanitario <https://iatistandard.org/es/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/humanitarianscopevocabulary/>`_"

# REVIEWED: ecbc6a99e88e003a
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:49
msgid ""
"A code for a recognised vocabulary used to classify emergencies, appeals, "
"and other humanitarian events and actions."
msgstr ""
"Código de un vocabulario reconocido utilizado para clasificar emergencias, "
"llamamientos y otros episodios y acciones humanitarias."

# REVIEWED: 4f3e2b4854e06223
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:51
msgid "`Participating Organisation <https://iatiregistry.org/publisher/>`_"
msgstr "`Organización participante <https://iatiregistry.org/publisher/>`_"

# REVIEWED: f5598624075db006
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:52
msgid ""
"Organisations involved in an activity. This filter is not extensive, and "
"only includes Reporting Organisations who have registered data on the IATI "
"registry."
msgstr ""
"Las organizaciones que participan en una actividad. Este filtro no es "
"exhaustivo y solo incluye a las organizaciones que presentan informes que "
"han registrado datos en el Registro de la IATI."

# REVIEWED: cd0f9592da6e84a5
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:55
msgid ""
"To search for participating organisations not included in the dropdown menu,"
" you can insert their organisation-identifier (org-id) directly into the "
"d-portal url as follows:"
msgstr ""
"Para buscar organizaciones participantes no incluidas en el menú "
"desplegable, puede insertar su identificador de organización (org-id) "
"directamente en la url de d-portal de la siguiente manera:"

# REVIEWED: 2b6b86a6da3c89ac
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:57
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
":samp:`https://d-portal.iatistandard.org/ctrack.html?&/participating-"
"org@ref={org-id}#view=main`"
msgstr ""
":samp:`https://d-portal.iatistandard.org/ctrack.html?&/participating-"
"org@ref={org-id}#view=main`"

# REVIEWED: 4c52b4b913692b12
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:59
msgid ""
"This allows you to see all activities involving participating organisations "
"which do not report IATI data themselves."
msgstr ""
"Esto le permite ver todas las actividades que involucran a organizaciones "
"participantes que no publican datos IATI por sí mismas."

# REVIEWED: 484093f5f90f27c6
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:61
msgid "Policy Marker"
msgstr "Marcador de políticas"

# REVIEWED: 7f8e401f7a4cedfc
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:62
msgid ""
"A combination of `Policy Significance <https://iatistandard.org/en/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/policysignificance/>`_ and `Policy Marker "
"<https://iatistandard.org/en/iati-standard/203/codelists/policymarker/>`_ "
"codes. These define a policy or theme addressed by the activity, and the "
"significance of the policy marker for this activity. For example, the code "
"**0_4** filters for \"not targeted, Trade Development\", while **2_4** "
"filters for \"principal objective, Trade Development\"."
msgstr ""
"Combinación de los códigos `Policy Significance "
"<https://iatistandard.org/es/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/policysignificance/>`_ y `Marcador de políticas "
"<https://iatistandard.org/es/iati-standard/203/codelists/policymarker/>`_. "
"Especifican una política o un tema abordado por la actividad, así como la "
"importancia del marcador de políticas para esa actividad. Por ejemplo, el "
"código **0_4** filtra para \"no objetivo, Desarrollo comercial\", mientras "
"que **2_4** filtra para \"objetivo principal, Desarrollo comercial\"."

# REVIEWED: 6cdc6d7ff2cc2af0
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:67
msgid "`Reporting Organisation <https://iatiregistry.org/publisher/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Organización que presenta el informe "
"<https://iatiregistry.org/publisher/>`_"

# REVIEWED: 231ef613dfc7bb4f
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:68
msgid "The organisation reporting an activity, taken from the IATI Registry."
msgstr ""
"La organización que informa de una actividad, extraída del Registro de la "
"IATI."

# REVIEWED: bf77064ccb7dbca3
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:72
msgid ""
"To search for reporting organisations not included in the dropdown menu, you"
" can insert their organisation-identifier (org-id) directly into the "
"d-portal url as follows:"
msgstr ""
"Para buscar organizaciones que presentan informes no incluidas en el menú "
"desplegable, puede insertar su identificador de la organización (org-id) "
"directamente en la URL de d-portal de la siguiente manera:"

# REVIEWED: 6cf49cf3b2f65eb3
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:74
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
":samp:`https://d-portal.iatistandard.org/ctrack.html?&reporting_ref={org-"
"id}#view=main`"
msgstr ""
":samp:`https://d-portal.iatistandard.org/ctrack.html?&reporting_ref={org-"
"id}#view=main`"

# REVIEWED: ecbadb3d492c7f56
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:76
msgid ""
"This allows you to access an organisation's data when they are not using "
"their validated organisation-identifier in their publication."
msgstr ""
"Esto le permite acceder a los datos de una organización cuando esta no está "
"utilizando su identificador de organización validado en su publicación."

# REVIEWED: b8876f4f8093e686
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:78
msgid ""
"`Recipient Country <https://iatistandard.org/en/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/country/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`País receptor <https://iatistandard.org/es/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/country/>`_"

# REVIEWED: 7f817b6b83c6a692
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:79
msgid ""
"An ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 code specifying the recipient country of an activity "
"or transaction."
msgstr ""
"Un código ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 que especifica el país receptor de una "
"actividad o transacción."

# REVIEWED: f94b3b52676dc213
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:81
msgid ""
"`Related Activity Type <https://iatistandard.org/en/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/relatedactivitytype/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Tipo de actividad relacionada <https://iatistandard.org/es/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/relatedactivitytype/>`_"

# REVIEWED: 52a5379fd0fe6cea
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:82
msgid ""
"A code defining the relationship between an IATI activity and another, "
"separately reported IATI activity."
msgstr ""
"Código que indica la relación entre una actividad de la IATI y otra "
"actividad de la IATI notificada por separado."

# REVIEWED: a4d30195311af134
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:84
msgid ""
"`Result Type <https://iatistandard.org/en/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/resulttype/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Tipo de resultado <https://iatistandard.org/es/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/resulttype/>`_"

# REVIEWED: fb380baedb987b5f
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:85
msgid "A code defining the type of result being reported in an activity."
msgstr ""
"Código que indica el tipo de resultado que se comunica en una actividad."

# REVIEWED: 7d648019b62d33e2
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:87
msgid ""
"`Sector <https://iatistandard.org/en/iati-standard/203/codelists/sector/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Sector <https://iatistandard.org/es/iati-standard/203/codelists/sector/>`_"

# REVIEWED: 06500b52496bee8f
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:88
msgid ""
"An OECD DAC 5-digit code classifying the purpose of an activity or "
"transaction."
msgstr ""
"Código de 5 dígitos del CAD de la OCDE que clasifica la finalidad de una "
"actividad o transacción."

# REVIEWED: 0b87652a3561ed5e
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:90
msgid ""
"`Sector Group <https://iatistandard.org/en/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/sectorcategory/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Grupo de sector <https://iatistandard.org/es/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/sectorcategory/>`_"

# REVIEWED: 432a2973902eccf5
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:91
msgid ""
"An OECD DAC 3-digit code classifying the purpose of an activity or "
"transaction."
msgstr ""
"Código de 3 dígitos del CAD de la OCDE que clasifica la finalidad de una "
"actividad o transacción."

# REVIEWED: 9765f38b230d24a7
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:93
msgid ""
"`Tag Vocabulary <https://iatistandard.org/en/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/tagvocabulary/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Vocabulario de etiquetas <https://iatistandard.org/es/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/tagvocabulary/>`_"

# REVIEWED: b8586b2a420d0683
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:94
msgid ""
"A code defining the tag classification vocabulary used in an activity. For "
"example, the UN Sustainable Development Goals codelist."
msgstr ""
"Código que indica el vocabulario de clasificación de etiquetas utilizado en "
"una actividad. Por ejemplo, la lista de códigos de los Objetivos de "
"Desarrollo Sostenible de las Naciones Unidas."

# REVIEWED: e51dac8b3a822ef9
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:96
msgid "Total Outgoing Commitment"
msgstr "Compromisos salientes totales"

# REVIEWED: ac2580e7bc445310
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:97
msgid ""
"The sum of all outgoing commitment `type transactions "
"<https://iatistandard.org/en/iati-standard/203/codelists/transactiontype/>`_"
" in an activity. This can be used to filter activities by minimum and/or "
"maximum total Outgoing Commitment."
msgstr ""
"La suma de todos los `tipos de transacciones "
"<https://iatistandard.org/es/iati-standard/203/codelists/transactiontype/>`_"
" que sean compromisos salientes en una actividad. Se puede utilizar para "
"filtrar las actividades por compromiso saliente total mínimo o máximo."

# REVIEWED: d04d7b36f961a694
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:100
msgid ""
"`Transaction Type <https://iatistandard.org/en/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/transactiontype/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Tipo de transacción <https://iatistandard.org/es/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/transactiontype/>`_"

# REVIEWED: 631067ec1c12c47c
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:101
msgid ""
"A code defining the type of transactions in an activity, for example "
"disbursements, or incoming commitments."
msgstr ""
"Código que indica el tipo de transacciones de una actividad, por ejemplo, "
"los desembolsos o los compromisos recibidos."

# REVIEWED: 93d8c177767f080b
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:103
msgid "Year Range"
msgstr "Rango de años"

# REVIEWED: 849f0f5871724d84
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:104
msgid ""
"The start and/or end year of an activity, taken from actual and planned "
"activity dates. The filter looks for activities that were active in the "
"period between the minimum and maximum year. So activities that started "
"before the end of the max year and ended after the start of the minimum year"
" will be returned."
msgstr ""
"El año de inicio y/o finalización de una actividad, tomado de las fechas "
"reales y planificadas de la actividad. El filtro busca actividades que "
"estuvieron activas en el período comprendido entre el año mínimo y el año "
"máximo. Por lo tanto, se devolverán las actividades que comenzaron antes del"
" final del año máximo y terminaron después del inicio del año mínimo."
